{"title":"2015 CEMC Euclid Problems/Problem 2a","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_2\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2015 CEMC Euclid Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_2a&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/2/6c2d737531e362dcfda3cd390259d55864528ccb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{a} + \\sqrt{a} = 20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"116\" height=\"21\" />, what is the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_2a&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/2/6c2d737531e362dcfda3cd390259d55864528ccb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{a} + \\sqrt{a} = 20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"116\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/9/d19ed9c63c2e90ab21371846fdf04d3af674dbf5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2 \\times \\sqrt{a} = 20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"100\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/6/ee63fef26b0b5780b37083639be74ba19bf41154.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{a} = \\frac{20}{2} = 10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"115\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/e/4/1e454ad890c3b14d05627242b9c74cc4aaa6c405.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = 10^{2} = \\boxed{100}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"124\" height=\"25\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018000302\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.009 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.014 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 32/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 78/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1149/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    6.189      1 2015_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_2\n100.00%    6.189      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:36016:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018000302 and revision id 279633. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}